Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: ollama
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/ollama/ollama
Source: https://github.com/ollama/ollama (tag v0.40.16) and its release files
Comment: The release bundles are repacked: NVIDIA's CUDA libraries, the CUDA 12 runner, GCC's OpenMP library and the copies of
 libdrm, libnuma and libelf are left out, each with its size, SHA-256 and reason in release/EXCLUDED.tsv (installed as
 /usr/share/doc/ollama/EXCLUDED.tsv). The licence texts of the components upstream's bundle names are installed beside the
 libraries in /usr/lib/ollama (*_LICENSE, *_NOTICE); AMD's ROCm 7.2.1 licences, which the bundle does not carry, come from AMD's
 repositories at the tag rocm-7.2.1 and are installed in /usr/share/doc/ollama-rocm/licences.

